# Local development ports.
#
# The Vite dev server proxies /api to this target, so the browser only ever
# talks to one origin (http://localhost:3000) and CORS never enters into it.
# Change the port here and nothing else needs editing — the API client calls a
# relative /api path and follows the proxy.
#
# Keep this in step with the port Django is actually started on:
#   backend/.venv/Scripts/python manage.py runserver 9000
# or, using the project's launcher:
#   ECHOSENSE_API_PORT=9000 npm run dev
VITE_API_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:9000
